<section class="auction-room-head"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">THE HEAVYLINE AUCTION ROOM</span><h1>Find your next workhorse.</h1><p>Live lots. Clear condition details. Your next move, all in one place.</p><div class="auction-room-stats"><div><strong><%= total %></strong><span>Auctions open</span></div><div><strong><%= closingCount %></strong><span>Closing within 24 hours</span></div><div><strong><%= brand.terms.buyerPremiumPercent %>%</strong><span>Buyer’s premium</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="room-tools"><div><h2>On the block</h2><p class="muted small">Ordered by closing time. Select up to three machines to compare.</p></div><label>Show <select class="input" data-auction-window><option value="all">All live lots</option><option value="24">Closing in 24 hours</option><option value="48">Closing in 48 hours</option></select></label></div><div class="grid grid-3" data-auction-grid><% listings.forEach(function(lot){ %><div data-auction-end="<%= lot.auction_ends_at %>"><%- include('../partials/auction-card',{lot}) %></div><% }) %></div><p class="room-empty" data-room-empty <%= listings.length ? 'hidden' : '' %>>No auctions in this window. <a href="/inventory">Browse all equipment</a> or choose a wider closing window.</p></div></section>